(label "SCL" (at 238.76 50.80 270) (fields_autoplaced yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid "b4d94660-af30-4139-b13f-1d61753c96a5"))
(text "256Kb (32Kx8) I2C EEPROM, 400 kHz, 2.5-5.5 V, SOIC-8 - 24LC256T-I/SN (alt 24AA256T-I/SN)\nLAYOUT: 100 nF at VCC pin (<=2 mm), via straight to GND plane. Route SDA/SCL together, away from SW nodes / clocks.\nI2C needs no series termination; ONE set of 4.7k pull-ups per bus (fit here only if bus has none). Rp_max = tr / (0.847 x Cbus): 400 kHz tr=300 ns, 1 MHz tr=120 ns.\nAddress straps: fit EITHER the GND 0R OR the VDD 0R per pin, never both. WP: internal pull-down to VSS; 10k pull-down keeps writes enabled - drive high from MCU to protect.\nTypical use: board ID / calibration / config storage. Rename SDA / SCL / WP / VDD labels to your nets." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.40 132.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5c15e4df-89bb-4333-bfac-a7cd8b537bf7"))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
)
